"**What happened**\n\n(what you saw, and what you expected)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. \n\n**Setup**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostics</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n" = "**Ce qui s'est passé**\n\n(ce que tu as vu, et ce que tu attendais)\n\n**Étapes**\n\n1. \n\n**Configuration**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu écran(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostic</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n";
